(setq register-alist '((48 . #("**** 3. Influence and Deal Flow\nYou mentioned growing influence. Freelancing, done smartly, is a direct pipeline to influence.\nWhen you solve a crucial, difficult problem for a respectable company, they become your reference point. That successful project becomes a piece of evidence—a \"proof of concept\"—that you can point to when negotiating your next, even bigger contract.\n-   /Influence Investment:/ If you take a slightly lower-paying but highly visible project for a well-known tech firm (one with good PR), you are essentially advertising your competence. You might take a small hit on immediate profit, but the long-term influence gain is worth three times the initial fee in future deals.\n\n" 0 3 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) face org-hide fontified t) 3 5 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) face org-level-4 fontified t) 5 31 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) face org-level-4 fontified t) 31 32 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) fontified t) 32 127 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) fontified t) 127 377 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) fontified t) 377 381 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) fontified t) 381 382 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) invisible t org-emphasis t font-lock-multiline t fontified t) 382 403 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) org-emphasis t font-lock-multiline t face (italic) fontified t) 403 404 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) invisible t org-emphasis t font-lock-multiline t rear-nonsticky (mouse-face highlight keymap invisible intangible help-echo org-linked-text htmlize-link) fontified t) 404 526 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) fontified t) 526 699 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) fontified t) 699 700 (yank-handler (evil-yank-line-handler nil t) face nil fontified t)))))
